  <!-- ── I. CHRONOLOGY OF TERROR ──────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-eyebrow" data-lang-en>The Record</div>
    <div class="section-eyebrow" data-lang-es style="display:none;">El Registro</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang-en>September 11: Chronology of Terror</div>
    <div class="section-title" data-lang-es style="display:none;">11 de Septiembre: Cronología del Terror</div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">8:45 a.m.</span>
      A hijacked passenger jet, American Airlines Flight 11 out of Boston, Massachusetts, crashes into the north tower of the World Trade Center, tearing a gaping hole in the building and setting it afire.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">8:45 a.m.</span>
      Un avión de pasajeros secuestrado, el Vuelo 11 de American Airlines con salida de Boston, Massachusetts, se estrella contra la torre norte del World Trade Center, abriendo una enorme brecha en el edificio y prendiéndolo en llamas.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">9:03 a.m.</span>
      A second hijacked airliner, United Airlines Flight 175 from Boston, crashes into the south tower of the World Trade Center and explodes. Both buildings are burning.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">9:03 a.m.</span>
      Un segundo avión secuestrado, el Vuelo 175 de United Airlines proveniente de Boston, se estrella contra la torre sur del World Trade Center y explota. Ambas torres están en llamas.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">9:30 a.m.</span>
      President Bush, speaking in Sarasota, Florida, says the country has suffered an "apparent terrorist attack."
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">9:30 a.m.</span>
      El presidente Bush, hablando en Sarasota, Florida, declara que el país ha sufrido un "aparente ataque terrorista."
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">9:43 a.m.</span>
      American Airlines Flight 77 crashes into the Pentagon, sending up a huge plume of smoke. Evacuation begins immediately.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">9:43 a.m.</span>
      El Vuelo 77 de American Airlines se estrella contra el Pentágono, levantando una enorme columna de humo. La evacuación comienza de inmediato.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">10:05 a.m.</span>
      The south tower of the World Trade Center collapses, plummeting into the streets below. A massive cloud of dust and debris forms and slowly drifts away from the building.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">10:05 a.m.</span>
      La torre sur del World Trade Center se derrumba hacia las calles de abajo. Una enorme nube de polvo y escombros se forma y se aleja lentamente del edificio.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">10:10 a.m.</span>
      A portion of the Pentagon collapses.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">10:10 a.m.</span>
      Una parte del Pentágono se derrumba.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">10:10 a.m.</span>
      United Airlines Flight 93, also hijacked, crashes in Somerset County, Pennsylvania, southeast of Pittsburgh.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">10:10 a.m.</span>
      El Vuelo 93 de United Airlines, también secuestrado, se estrella en el condado de Somerset, Pensilvania, al sureste de Pittsburgh.
    </div>

    <div class="chronology" data-lang-en>
      <span class="chrono-time">10:28 a.m.</span>
      The World Trade Center's north tower collapses from the top down as if it were being peeled apart, releasing a tremendous cloud of debris and smoke.
    </div>
    <div class="chronology" data-lang-es style="display:none;">
      <span class="chrono-time">10:28 a.m.</span>
      La torre norte del World Trade Center se derrumba de arriba abajo, liberando una tremenda nube de escombros y humo.
    </div>

    <div class="section-desc" data-lang-en style="margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);">
      <strong>Toll:</strong> 2,977 people killed. 19 hijackers. Four aircraft. Victims from 90 nations.
      Six months later, the death toll from illness and injury related to Ground Zero rescue and recovery work continued to climb.
      <br><br>
      <strong>Source:</strong> CNN/U.S.
    </div>
    <div class="section-desc" data-lang-es style="display:none;margin-top:20px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);">
      <strong>Víctimas:</strong> 2.977 personas fallecidas. 19 secuestradores. Cuatro aeronaves. Víctimas de 90 naciones. Seis meses después, el número de muertes por enfermedades y lesiones relacionadas con los trabajos de rescate en Zona Cero continuó aumentando.<br><br><strong>Fuente:</strong> CNN/EE.UU.
    </div>
  </div>

