      Pero, oh, cuánto la hemos distorsionado.
    </div>

    <div class="responsive-text" data-speaker="all" data-lang-en>
      <span class="response-label">All</span>
      When we recall the beastly acts of people,<br>
      We are ashamed to be human.<br>
      When we read of the nobility of their victims,<br>
      We are proud to be Americans.
    </div>
